<Slide style={{
    background: '#F7FAF6',
    paddingTop: 20, paddingBottom: 20, paddingLeft: 72, paddingRight: 72,
}}>
    <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>为什么需要 AI宝儿</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#1F7A5C', marginTop: 8 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 528, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 528, gap: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F7A5C', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                一线顾问每天在反复接同一类问题
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 20, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='comments' style={{ fill: '#1F7A5C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>重复咨询高频</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                    便秘、腹胀、口臭、免疫力、皮肤状态……五类问题被反复问，回答却大同小异。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 20, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='moon' style={{ fill: '#1F7A5C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>夜间才想起来问</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                    客户常在下班后、深夜才有空想问题，人工很难做到 7×24 小时在线覆盖。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 20, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='user' style={{ fill: '#1F7A5C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>真人精力有限</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                    基础问答占满时间，留给深度沟通的余地就被挤没了。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 528, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 20, background: '#1F7A5C', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <FAIcon name='bullseye' style={{ fill: '#FFFFFF', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>AI宝儿的定位</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 16 }}>
                一个随时在线的小助手，把那些重复的「基础问答」先接住，让你腾出手去做更该由人来做的事——深度沟通与判断。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <FAIcon name='check' style={{ fill: '#1F7A5C', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>不打烊：客户深夜问，它也在</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <FAIcon name='check' style={{ fill: '#1F7A5C', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>不重复：基础问题交给它，不占你时间</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <FAIcon name='check' style={{ fill: '#1F7A5C', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>不替代：拿不准时，它帮你接真人</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, background: 'rgba(224,138,60,0.14)', borderRadius: 14, padding: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C9742B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    注：便秘/腹胀等五类场景取自项目案例库，仅说明「被问得多」，不作任何疗效承诺。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 21C12 21 4 17 4 10C4 6 7 3 12 3C17 3 20 6 20 10C20 17 12 21 12 21Z" fill="#1F7A5C" opacity="0.75" />
                <path d="M12 21V6" stroke="#FFFFFF" strokeWidth="1.6" fill="none" />
            </svg>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7C75' }}>AI宝儿 · 入门与上手</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7C75' }}>02 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
